{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32626","headline":"访友人郊居 · 刘沧","name":"访友人郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登原过水访相如，竹坞莎庭似故居。\n空塞山当清昼晚，古槐人继绿阴余。\n休弹瑟韵伤离思，已有蝉声报夏初。\n醉唱劳歌翻自叹，钓船渔浦梦难疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}